@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy";
}

<h1 class="mb-4">@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<div class="container">
    <div class="mb-5">
        <div>
            <p>
                Sunrise Shelter is committed to protecting the privacy and personal information of all users, including parents, children, and administrators. This policy outlines how we collect, use, store, and protect your data.
            </p>

            <h4 class="mt-4">1. Information We Collect</h4>
            <ul>
                <li>Personal details such as names, contact information, and identification numbers</li>
                <li>Adoption-related data including application dates, statuses, and messages</li>
                <li>System usage logs and form submissions</li>
            </ul>

            <h4 class="mt-4">2. How We Use Your Information</h4>
            <ul>
                <li>To manage adoption applications and match children with suitable parents</li>
                <li>To generate reports and improve system functionality</li>
                <li>To ensure legal, ethical, and cultural compliance</li>
            </ul>

            <h4 class="mt-4">3. Data Security</h4>
            <p>
                All data is stored securely using encrypted connections and access controls. Only authorized personnel can view or modify sensitive records. We regularly test and refine our system to guard against unauthorized access and misuse.
            </p>

            <h4 class="mt-4">4. User Rights</h4>
            <ul>
                <li>You may request access to your personal data at any time</li>
                <li>You may request corrections or deletions where appropriate</li>
                <li>You may contact us to understand how your data is used</li>
            </ul>

            <h4 class="mt-4">5. Legal and Ethical Considerations</h4>
            <p>
                Sunrise Shelter complies with all relevant privacy laws and ethical standards. We respect cultural sensitivities and ensure responsible data handling across all interactions.
            </p>

            <h4 class="mt-4">6. Contact</h4>
            <p>
                For questions or concerns about this privacy policy, please contact the system administrator or email us at <strong>info@sunriseshelter.org</strong>.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
